  "description": "Containers, metadata, subtitles; no decoding. This preview reads and writes containers, edits tags, remuxes, trims and makes files playable, strips location and device identifiers, writes capture dates, and has first previews of subtitles and captions, capture facts, telemetry and timed events. A managed media container library with no dependency beyond .NET: sources, exact media time, limits, typed defects, content sniffing and the track and packet model that the format readers build on. Unaffiliated with other products or companies named OneMedia.",
